  "description": "Overlooking the outdoor pool with its terrace, Il Terrazzo features the simplicity of Italian cuisine in an inviting ambiance, complemented by the taste, texture, and aroma of the homemade Italian dishes cooked in a stove oven by experienced chefs. Our Neapolitane pizzas are made in our stone oven and brought directly to your table, ensuring an authentic and delightful dining experience. The service and hospitality at Il Terrazzo are very unique, coming straight from the heart. What's more, we offer a range of dining options to cater to all our guests' needs, including gluten-free options for those with dietary preferences or restrictions. It's not just a meal; it's an experience of Italian culinary excellence, served with seasonal ingredients to savor the freshest flavors.",
